            <div xml:id="m-0adf52a3-6691-4021-9180-8aa63f04a754">
              <lg xml:id="m-ed2c22c1-aa10-46e1-87ca-60edcca9dab6">
                <l xml:id="m-3d25b867-fbdb-4b64-a523-8c9d75a656c3" facs="#m-2c04a0a4-698f-4ed8-892a-cba73ba02210" label="ambiguous">Conftebor. S. a.</l><l xml:id="m-6322022d-33c1-436b-bcdc-17ece150db3f" facs="#m-59959e31-84f7-4ca1-824e-b75a0d3bc8f4" label="ambiguous">138</l><l xml:id="m-46940bfe-0632-482e-98e1-96d5b4322f1d" facs="#m-13eae681-be3b-487c-92a9-a8880e0e9d7c" label="lyrics-like">5. Mémor érit in saéculum testaménti sui :* virtútem óperum suórum</l><l xml:id="m-d5113357-ec3b-418b-b8ba-10660ee81bb7" facs="#m-5672a34e-2f09-4a00-bbe5-7e021411ac3c" label="lyrics-like">annuntiábit pópulo súo:</l><l xml:id="m-5f318bf7-4db9-4ce3-b6a9-74ad06ce6df5" facs="#m-f49804e3-2f12-4a72-99dc-07803f447959" label="lyrics-like">6. Ut det fllis haereditátem géntium:“pera mánuum éjus véritas</l><l xml:id="m-e2721d8d-afab-44d0-8dde-f4d81eaf3634" facs="#m-9d84f072-e772-4ca8-aef3-fb399fb28f41" label="ambiguous">Judicium.E:Jadielum.)</l><l xml:id="m-c8fe2bd8-e103-47b7-8ea6-a10f8af65c91" facs="#m-0b9fd1f4-4b5b-47b1-8a2f-2e01bead6a0e" label="lyrics-like">7. Fidélia ómnia mandáta éius: t confirmáta in saéculum saéculi:</l><l xml:id="m-bb5df227-e641-4378-a54b-7fe6ed56af7a" facs="#m-a17fd2aa-c7c4-4527-961d-d0f129c27db8" label="lyrics-like">fâcta in veritáte et aequitâte.</l><l xml:id="m-38151d43-b92e-4879-b96a-d15a2f910b64" facs="#m-23845b62-8643-47d2-a796-35b21bc68c3e" label="lyrics-like">8. Redemptiónem mísit pópulo súo:“mandávit in aetérnum testa¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b832291-bf83-44de-a4ac-52adad7d5279" facs="#m-354c7c60-bffa-49f2-b0e6-b7fba302fa31" label="lyrics-like">méntum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-97b594b2-aaee-4e3b-a1de-4c0642a935dd" facs="#m-e7dfc528-6928-4f64-a661-a94c1934f99d" label="lyrics-like">9. Sánctum et terribile nómen éjus: * initium sapiéntice timor</l><l xml:id="m-1f4ac85e-4733-4197-98ca-2a1fec814385" facs="#m-46c2411b-14ec-4afe-b8a6-484684cf2491" label="lyrics-like">Dómini. (E: Dómini.)</l><l xml:id="m-badd875d-d5c2-484c-9fa2-91ca32d23322" facs="#m-c37c2583-25d7-4f32-85c3-b23c816953d8" label="lyrics-like">10. Intelléctus bónus ómnibus faciéntibus éum:“laudátio éjus mánet</l><l xml:id="m-950413ad-3569-4dc7-9aba-41ce04dfcdfc" facs="#m-602cffcc-b850-43d6-82f3-316260169426" label="lyrics-like">in scéculum saéculi. (E: saéculi.)</l><l xml:id="m-b1c186a9-02ca-426a-9793-a8ab705bf04d" facs="#m-dac903af-c3fb-469d-af8c-94e490f34cfa" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-e18a7401-0516-419e-a94a-e458be582d29" facs="#m-5e992a90-e37e-46bc-a3fa-b00de3488d70" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5f516978-835e-4ea5-b723-ceac1ac02f79" facs="#m-c261c8cb-5c56-4c21-86ab-bed8ceb77160" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-469b1e53-50cb-4a2a-a144-a7d4da42aa7f" facs="#m-9d4a3c30-d431-401c-8e81-08a31b82ea9b" label="ambiguous">Tone 5. a.</l><l xml:id="m-a363c418-7b92-42b1-b144-ef3c65f48b17" facs="#m-3667adc1-a923-4490-997a-9803f10cc3b3" label="text-like">Mediant of r accent.</l><l xml:id="m-41f25d01-df3a-4bcf-a4c5-e813e5084a00" facs="#m-1da6179d-f475-4b7d-806e-78d0bebeccc1" label="text-like">Ending of a accents.</l><l xml:id="m-4d6ddeed-86f8-47e9-a913-27430779f350" facs="#m-4e0c3910-24c4-4106-82ae-175c556f941b" label="lyrics-like">1. Confitébor tibi Dómine in tóto córde mé¬n consi-li-o</l><l xml:id="m-abdbf355-7431-42b3-ba79-12c1a32765f7" facs="#m-101a7689-9540-4610-b6c1-0743de2c57f0" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-0310e2ce-1eb4-4147-b9b1-d56656718a92" facs="#m-7bc0f040-cc3e-453e-b489-f04a0d3ab03d" label="lyrics-like">justórum et congrega- ti-ó- ne. Flex : su-órum,</l><l xml:id="m-3d2780a1-3daf-4fbd-aeb5-adc75b48f81e" facs="#m-9205fb96-1655-4c48-b861-361fcf246336" label="lyrics-like">2. Mágna ópera Dómini: “exquisita in ómnes voluntâtes éius.</l><l xml:id="m-afcdd74e-cf4c-41c9-b9f8-51134c9cd831" facs="#m-e0ba98b4-75b1-4175-bec5-bb25d99f2ca5" label="lyrics-like">3. Conféssio et magnificéntia ópus éjus:“ et justitia éjus mánet in</l><l xml:id="m-35a488ad-9411-4b3d-b9e3-4ec9de39e1a6" facs="#m-d47eeb9f-0fe1-4199-bf98-0e5bde968158" label="lyrics-like">saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-013590c0-c0e0-4538-9202-1bf83c19ca17" facs="#m-c79ee89f-ea42-4be7-84a0-268fad6ad7c7" label="lyrics-like">4. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum, t miséricors et miserátor</l><l xml:id="m-e8dba09e-c6f3-4971-8421-a79fbb626ce7" facs="#m-7683647c-2bb7-44d8-ab2b-06b67fbcb6bb" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus:“éscam dédit timéntibus se.</l><l xml:id="m-11b5610c-f4ca-4652-ad3f-04c4fc2a3df1" facs="#m-565efbf6-4e20-4ab7-9489-897b0019ad9f" label="lyrics-like">5. Mémor érit in saéculum testaménti sui :* virtútem óperum suórum</l><l xml:id="m-f145d64f-335a-41fc-b22c-a71112b8d87f" facs="#m-5de90bef-a11e-42f1-a8cc-3d6c5dffdbe0" label="lyrics-like">annuntiábit pópulo súo:</l><l xml:id="m-5b80397f-e602-484a-a7cd-5eea2082c3bd" facs="#m-d8b1310f-2e76-49d0-a5f0-0a7508c9fb12" label="lyrics-like">6. Ut det illis haereditátem géntium: “opera mánuum éjus véritas</l><l xml:id="m-39e57e61-d465-4857-b4f3-796db880d0b0" facs="#m-7800024d-7c06-49bb-92a0-d00a764346b0" label="ambiguous">et judicium.</l><l xml:id="m-29ae28db-18dc-4559-b074-43c8707ed592" facs="#m-fc773b4e-46a2-4140-890a-ebec52cf1784" label="lyrics-like">7. Fidélia ómnia mandáta éjus: t confirmáta in saéculum saéculi:*</l><l xml:id="m-83e21b59-57e8-4255-938b-80320b166e16" facs="#m-ab7e5205-da9a-4055-81ca-3982cbb3df57" label="lyrics-like">fácta in veritáte et aequitâte.</l><l xml:id="m-21877939-65dc-4a60-a32f-09c07b675b5d" facs="#m-d56f1bc7-1ee0-4705-9053-e235c4cf9f5d" label="lyrics-like">8. Redemptiónem mísit pópulo súo:“mandávit in aetérnum testa¬</l><l xml:id="m-d943ca12-15a0-4311-90db-bd0286d3f883" facs="#m-2fc620bd-84b2-44f3-99bb-2e1e520b7bf4" label="lyrics-like">méntum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-702c956d-185e-4055-b635-2db1ea028f3a" facs="#m-3589be74-2a3e-487c-b335-da281968b719" label="lyrics-like">9. Sánctum et terribile nómen éjus: * initium sapiéntiae timor</l><l xml:id="m-e7f7178e-df50-4cab-8689-5d1fa8019ddf" facs="#m-38e655a4-37a0-40eb-a1d7-666d72033a05" label="lyrics-like">Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-37004e69-74f6-4235-aec2-85c1604cc4ab" facs="#m-aba98e87-7b35-46ac-af9d-7d933fa05274" label="lyrics-like">10. Intelléctus bónus ómnibus faciéntibus éum:“laudátio éjus mánet</l><l xml:id="m-2a5fcfcf-e1b7-4700-85dc-72ff23afb6ef" facs="#m-0b3aaebf-97ef-494e-8741-f41374eab3e4" label="lyrics-like">in saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-b31390f4-187e-40c1-9d87-7e871e8c9985" facs="#m-b6328223-b4d2-4c92-abfd-2a3d40a0b64a" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-6329f682-671b-4f1d-b0a0-69915a4c8282" facs="#m-12590d19-dafc-46ae-be41-7633d9e58bff" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc. et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l></lg>
